  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds caller-issued change labels to MappedTextDiff. A TextDiffChangeLabel carries inert one-line text, Normal or Subdued emphasis, an opt-in visible-whitespace flag, and an optional related-change address. Differently labeled changes never share a hunk or a line; unified output writes the label after the hunk header and stays applicable by GNU patch at bounded context; Unicode and Spectre print label lines, subdue secondary changes, and render spaces and tabs as visible glyphs inside inner-mapping spans; structured output adds change_label, label_emphasis, and related_change.",
